%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'fontSize':'14px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant L as Landing (/)
    participant SI as Sign-in/up
    participant CK as Clerk OAuth
    participant RD as /redirect
    participant API as /api/auth/redirect
    participant DB as Prisma + Neon
    participant DASH as Role Dashboard

    U->>L: Pick role (individual / sales_person / sales_manager)
    L->>SI: Navigate with ?type=...
    Note over SI: Role persisted to sessionStorage<br>+ localStorage (verso_selected_user_type)
    SI->>CK: Authenticate (or demo mode fallback)
    CK-->>SI: Authenticated (clerkId)
    SI->>RD: /redirect?type=...
    RD->>API: POST {selectedUserType}
    API->>DB: Upsert User.userType<br>+ Create UserStreak
    Note over API: If new user: fetch from<br>Clerk REST API (Bearer SECRET_KEY)
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>RD: {redirectUrl, userType, userName}

    alt userType = SALES_MANAGER
        RD->>DASH: /manager-dashboard
    else userType = SALES_PERSON
        RD->>DASH: /sales-dashboard
    else userType = INDIVIDUAL
        RD->>DASH: /home
    end

    Note over DASH: Optional: /complete-profile<br>captures phone, org, manager email<br>(generates MGR-xxxxxx for managers)
